cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Dutch Legal AI Benchmark (DELTA)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Legal Benchmarks"
    website: "https://www.legalbenchmarks.ai"
  - name: "Zeno.Law"
    website: "https://zeno.law"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-30
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/legalbenchmarks/delta"
abstract: >-
  An open task set for legal research in the law of the Netherlands:
  15 tasks with 273 binary, lawyer-calibrated grading criteria across 9
  practice areas. The tasks were selected from a collection of more than 200
  legal-research assignments reflecting questions encountered in Dutch legal
  practice. The public questions and assessment criteria were reviewed by
  practising Dutch lawyers. Legal Benchmarks curates and maintains the public
  benchmark, with Zeno.Law as Founding Research Partner. Dutch text is
  normative; English reference translations are included.
keywords:
  - legal research
  - dutch law
  - netherlands
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
  - legal ai
